WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.227 --> 00:00:02.994
Five, four, three, two, one.

00:00:02.994 --> 00:00:05.370
I'm going to Aruba.

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:08.037
(playful music)

00:00:10.958 --> 00:00:11.950
- [Interviewer] Do you like cake?

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:13.246
I love cake.

00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:15.134
- [Interviewer] Do you like fruits?

00:00:15.134 --> 00:00:16.051
Yeah, but

00:00:17.428 --> 00:00:20.516
for a snack today the
oranges weren't as good,

00:00:20.516 --> 00:00:22.057
but I like fruit.

00:00:22.057 --> 00:00:23.599
- [Interviewer] Have you
heard of a fruitcake before?

00:00:23.599 --> 00:00:24.432
No.

00:00:24.432 --> 00:00:26.936
- [Interviewer] What do you
think they're made out of?

00:00:26.936 --> 00:00:29.515
Strawberries, raspberries,
and blueberries.

00:00:29.515 --> 00:00:31.534
- [Interviewer] Are you
excited to try them?

00:00:31.534 --> 00:00:33.190
I'm very excited.

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:35.303
No (laughs).

00:00:35.303 --> 00:00:36.136
- [Interviewer] Why?

00:00:36.136 --> 00:00:39.493
Because it might have
crickets (crickets chirping).

00:00:39.493 --> 00:00:42.986
(playful music)

00:00:42.986 --> 00:00:45.273
(breathing excitedly)

00:00:45.273 --> 00:00:46.872
- [Interviewer] What
does it look like to you?

00:00:46.872 --> 00:00:48.622
A big mole of dirt.

00:00:50.387 --> 00:00:54.554
It smells like a blueberry
pancake and strawberry.

00:00:56.307 --> 00:01:00.033
I don't know, I'm gonna
try not to get the fruit.

00:01:00.033 --> 00:01:02.283
Blast off into space, mm!

00:01:05.313 --> 00:01:07.633
(gags) Nope, nope.

00:01:07.633 --> 00:01:10.883
Ew (spits out cake).

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:14.045
Mm!

00:01:14.045 --> 00:01:15.295
Tasty, yummy,

00:01:15.295 --> 00:01:16.872
and makes my

00:01:16.872 --> 00:01:17.705
belly feel

00:01:17.705 --> 00:01:18.538
super

00:01:19.546 --> 00:01:20.705
happy.

00:01:20.705 --> 00:01:23.372
(playful music)

00:01:24.208 --> 00:01:25.495
It's not the same thing.

00:01:25.495 --> 00:01:28.137
- [Interviewer] This
is apples and cinnamon.

00:01:28.137 --> 00:01:29.700
Mm, sounds good.

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:31.784
- [Interviewer] Do you think
you're gonna like this one?

00:01:31.784 --> 00:01:33.134
Yes I hope.

00:01:33.134 --> 00:01:35.415
It smells like cinnamon of course.

00:01:35.415 --> 00:01:39.693
Actually looks like
brownie with apples in it.

00:01:39.693 --> 00:01:41.360
Just take a piece.

00:01:43.076 --> 00:01:44.409
That was good.

00:01:47.523 --> 00:01:48.356
Tasty!

00:01:49.583 --> 00:01:50.416
Mm!

00:01:51.953 --> 00:01:53.120
Not too bad.

00:01:58.092 --> 00:01:59.495
- [Interviewer] It's that good?

00:01:59.495 --> 00:02:01.873
Would you eat more?

00:02:01.873 --> 00:02:03.100
No.

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:06.292
(playful music)

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:09.757
This one looks like bananas, or peach.

00:02:09.757 --> 00:02:11.498
- [Interviewer] So this
is actually a pineapple

00:02:11.498 --> 00:02:13.307
macadamia nut fruitcake.

00:02:13.307 --> 00:02:14.646
That doesn't sound so good.

00:02:14.646 --> 00:02:16.938
Do like pineapple sometimes,

00:02:16.938 --> 00:02:19.842
but sometimes they're just too sour.

00:02:19.842 --> 00:02:22.783
It reminds me of being at a party.

00:02:22.783 --> 00:02:26.746
The smell is gross,
but I bet I'll like it.

00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:28.192
Mm.

00:02:28.192 --> 00:02:29.025
Good.

00:02:32.508 --> 00:02:34.591
- [Interviewer] How good?

00:02:35.440 --> 00:02:36.360
Just good.

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:38.225
No, I don't want that.

00:02:38.225 --> 00:02:41.392
(spits out fruitcake)

00:02:42.441 --> 00:02:43.873
- [Interviewer] What did it taste like?

00:02:43.873 --> 00:02:45.396
Rotten gum.

00:02:45.396 --> 00:02:49.481
- [Interviewer] So did
you like those fruitcakes?

00:02:49.481 --> 00:02:51.425
Yeah a little.

00:02:51.425 --> 00:02:53.242
I would love to eat more.

00:02:53.242 --> 00:02:55.098
- [Interviewer] Why did
you like those fruitcakes?

00:02:55.098 --> 00:02:56.462
Cuz they were delicious.

00:02:56.462 --> 00:02:57.931
I liked the apple cinnamon one.

00:02:57.931 --> 00:03:01.413
I loved the pineapple
fruitcake cuz it was so good.

00:03:01.413 --> 00:03:02.515
- [Interviewer] So would
you eat more of that?

00:03:02.515 --> 00:03:04.928
No, why would I eat more of anything?

00:03:04.928 --> 00:03:05.761
I would,

00:03:06.979 --> 00:03:09.031
if my mom would bake it.

00:03:09.031 --> 00:03:10.522
- [Interviewer] So if you
could buy a fruitcake,

00:03:10.522 --> 00:03:12.128
who would you buy it for?

00:03:12.128 --> 00:03:13.036
Grandma.

00:03:13.036 --> 00:03:13.869
- [Interviewer] Why?

00:03:13.869 --> 00:03:15.243
Cuz she's that kind of person.

00:03:15.243 --> 00:03:16.799
- [Interviewer] What
kind of person is she?

00:03:16.799 --> 00:03:18.382
- [Blonde Boy] Old.

